### 二、上传模块的重复计算与冗余防御 (Upload Logic Simplification)

#### 1. 原生 `writeStream.bytesWritten` 替代手动监听 `req.on("data")`
- **位置**：[upload-handler.js#L52-L66](file:///source/build-data/upload-handler.js#L52-L66)
- **现状**：
  服务端代码为了返回上传的字节大小，手动在 `req` 上监听累加数据块：
  ```javascript
  let totalBytes = 0;
  req.on("data", (chunk) => { totalBytes += chunk.length; });
  req.pipe(writeStream);
  writeStream.on("finish", () => {
    res.status(200).json({ ok: true, path: targetPath, size: totalBytes, ... });
  });
  ```
- **精简建议**：Node.js 原生的 [`fs.WriteStream`](https://nodejs.org/api/fs.html#writestreambyteswritten) 自带 `writeStream.bytesWritten` 属性，在 `finish` 事件触发时直接读取即可。完全可以省去 `let totalBytes = 0` 及 `req.on("data")` 事件监听。

#### 2. 过度设计的多级路径回退级联 (Over-complicated Fallback Cascade)
- **位置**：[upload-handler.js#L16-L25](file:///source/build-data/upload-handler.js#L16-L25)
- **现状**：
  服务端为获取目标路径做了极其臃肿的回退处理：
  ```javascript
  let rawPath = req.query.path || req.query.dest || req.headers["x-file-path"] || "";
  if (!rawPath && req.query.filename) {
    const dir = req.query.dir || WORK_DIR;
    rawPath = path.join(dir, req.query.filename);
  }
  if (!rawPath && req.headers["x-file-name"]) {
    rawPath = path.join(WORK_DIR, req.headers["x-file-name"]);
  }
  ```
- **精简建议**：本项目的前端上传规范是统一在 URL 查询参数传入 `?path=...`，请求头携带 `X-File-Path` 作为兜底。其余的 `dest`、`filename`、`dir` 等属于无测试、无调用的历史残留防御分支，精简为一行：
  ```javascript
  let rawPath = String(req.query.path || req.headers["x-file-path"] || "").trim();
  ```

